{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Specify</b> is in the imperative mode, on the pattern of זכרה לי אלהי לטובה (Nehemiah 13:31). It means 'specify,' as in אשר פי יהוה יקבנו (Isaiah 22:14). The dagesh in the qof is because the nun is assimilated into it, like אשר ידבנו לבו (Exodus 25:2)."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:46:24.734061202Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}